h) Lane file resolution order: with a tmp `HARNESS`/`config/lanes/` layout (monkeypatch
   `executor.HARNESS`), confirm a project-specific `<project_id>/riggs.md` wins over
   the shared `lanes/riggs.md` fallback when both exist, and the fallback is used when
