   unknown project id is refused (400 / DispatchRefused), a valid one stamps
   `jobs.project_id`.
k) `gatekeeper.merge` uses the project's repo/branch: build a tmp repo for a test
   project (or reuse the jess row with a tmp repo, non-"main" default branch), create
   a job with that `project_id`, go through the same certified-and-shippable setup
   test_gatekeeper.py's `_reviewed_and_done`-style helper already builds (copy/adapt
