   `gatekeeper.merge`, and confirm it merged into THAT repo on THAT branch — not
   `gatekeeper.REPO`/`"main"`.
l) All existing tests in harness/tests/ must still pass unmodified — if your changes
   force ANY edit to an existing test file, STOP, re-read section 2's design decision
   above (the None-project-id legacy path), and fix your implementation instead
   (unless the existing test is asserting on something this task is explicitly
