codex
Project resolution and job stamping are now in place. New work is assigned a real project by default, older unassigned work retains the original behavior, and a protected notes-only project is refused before any private copy is created. I’m now carrying the same resolved project into the merge safety checks so review and shipping cannot drift to different codebases.
apply patch
